Package: fly
Title: Historic Airphoto Footprints, Selection and Georeferencing for
    British Columbia
Version: 0.24.0
Date: 2026-10-08
Authors@R: c(
    person("Allan", "Irvine", , "al@newgraphenvironment.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3495-2128",
                       affiliation = "New Graph Environment Ltd.")),
    person("New Graph Environment Ltd.", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
    )
Description: Estimate the ground each of British Columbia's historic
    airphotos covers, from its catalogued centroid and scale or, given an
    elevation model, from the aircraft's height above the ground after
    checking the catalogued flying height against the scale. Select the
    fewest photos that cover an area of interest, download scans and flight
    metadata from the BC Data Catalogue, and georeference the scans onto
    their estimated footprints.
